    ]}
  />

  <h2 id="which-to-choose">Which Should You Choose?</h2>
  <p>Because the internal structure is so similar, a video compressed with H.264 will look identical and have the same file size whether it's wrapped in a MOV container or an MP4 container.</p>
  <p>However, <strong>MP4 is the clear winner for everyday use</strong>. It is universally supported across all devices, operating systems, and web browsers. Only use MOV if you are working exclusively within the Apple ecosystem (like editing video on a Mac) and require support for professional Apple-specific codecs like ProRes.</p>
